# Solo OSS operator default v1 (all lanes)

**SSOT:** `docs/final/artifacts/mkm_solo_oss_release_policy_v1_latest.json` · `mkm_send_gate_vocabulary_v1_latest.json`

## Default (all lanes: Oracle · MS · Infra · Design · web_ops · …)

- **Release gate:** MIT + root `README.md` disclaimer + `.gitignore` secret wall + `check_mkm_solo_oss_release_readiness_v1.py` — **not** paid legal counsel / `counsel_signoff` / lawyer email bundles.
- **Public send:** `oss_github_release` → `SEND_GATE: OPEN` (GitHub explicit push only: `Push-GitHub-Explicit.ps1 -Acknowledge`).
- **Still HOLD/LOCKED:** grants · customer contracts · Track A · live trading — OSS OPEN does not lift these.

## ALWAYS (chat · MISSION_LOG next-action)

- Propose OSS path: README · LICENSE · bench reproduce · secret check · explicit GitHub push when relevant.
- Treat counsel handoff chains, worksheets, legal email drafts as **legacy reference only**.

## NEVER (unless commander explicitly requests lawyer/counsel/legal review)

- Do **not** suggest counsel submission, lawyer signoff, legal review bundles, or 「법무팀 송부」 as the default next step in **any** lane.
- Do **not** resurrect deprecated paths because artifacts exist on disk.
- Do **not** ask 「변호사 필요하신가요?」 proactively.

## Override (commander-only)

- Run counsel/legal workflows **only** when the user **explicitly** asks (e.g. 「변호사 검수 필요」, 「counsel bundle」, 「legal review」).
